+id: task-003-rfc-6902-patch-conformance
+type: task
+title: "RFC 6902 patch conformance"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Review and correct `applyPatch` so it implements RFC 6902 operation validation, JSON Pointer target
+handling, sequential evaluation, and error termination. Preserve the public guarantee that neither
+input is mutated, document the behavior, and cover valid operations plus malformed and failing patches.
